    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107887" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερτενής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretching over, laid
				over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκὸν . . ἀσπίδος ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					128
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs.,
				<i>tall,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίτυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					1.4.2
				</span></i>
			; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερτενῆ κρεμάσας ἐκ πίτυος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zen.
					4.81
				</span></i>
			.</div>
